0016:     rectangle directly above that position, offset upward by the rectangle's
0017:     height.
0018: 
0019:     Key insight
0020:     The vertical displacement is not shared globally: each rectangle jumps by
0021:     its own bbox height, so its new bottom edge is just above its old top edge.
